  <!-- Section 9: FAQ -->
  <section class="py-20 px-4 faq-section">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-12">Frequently asked questions</h2>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What can clients see in the portal?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>You control what's visible. Clients can access pedigrees, health records, photos, contracts, payment history, and messages, based on permissions you set.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Can clients make payments through the portal?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, when you accept card payments. Clients see their invoices, payment history, and balance, and pay from the invoice on a secure Stripe Checkout page. If you collect another way, the invoice shows your payment instructions instead.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Do clients need to download an app?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>No. The portal is web-based and works on any device with a browser. Access is by your invitation: the buyer opens the activation link in their email, sets a password, and signs in.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How does a buyer get into the portal?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Only because you gave them access. You can enable access from a contact or from a waitlist entry, and BreederHQ also sets it up when you send go-home documents, a pickup window invitation, an invoice, or a buyer selection turn. The buyer gets a Your Client Portal is Ready email with an activation link. Access you suspended or removed stays off.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Can buyers book their own go-home time?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>It is your choice per booking window. Buyers can pick an open time themselves and change or cancel it within your cutoffs, or you can schedule every buyer yourself. Buyers in a window you schedule see their time and can add it to a calendar, but they cannot book, change, or cancel it.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Can I message clients through the portal?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes. Built-in messaging keeps all communication in one place. Clients receive notifications when you send updates.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Is client data secure?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes. Each client has their own secure login and can only see information about their own animals and transactions. All data is encrypted.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

